                "content": "![Example 1](https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/doocs/leetcode@main/solution/0500-0599/0531.Lonely%20Pixel%20I/images/pixel1.jpg)\n\n```\nInput: picture = [[\"W\",\"W\",\"B\"],[\"W\",\"B\",\"W\"],[\"B\",\"W\",\"W\"]]\nOutput: 3\nExplanation: All the three 'B's are black lonely pixels.\n```"
            },
            {
                "content": "```\nInput: picture = [[\"B\",\"B\",\"B\"],[\"B\",\"B\",\"W\"],[\"B\",\"B\",\"B\"]]\nOutput: 0\n```"
